    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Lisaaye lia Saulo liirwa",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 21:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mu bwami bwa Daudi enjala yabao engali khulwe kimiiko kitaru. Khwako Daudi aasaba Wele Omunyali Owa Bioosi. Nio Wele Omunyali Owa Bioosi aloma ali, “Saulo ne lisaaye liewe bali ne sifuki. Beera babaandu ba Kibeoni.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.21.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.21.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 21:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "JOS.9.3+JOS.9.4+JOS.9.5+JOS.9.6+JOS.9.7+JOS.9.8+JOS.9.9+JOS.9.10+JOS.9.11+JOS.9.12+JOS.9.13+JOS.9.14+JOS.9.15"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Yosh. 9.3-15",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Omwami alaanga Bakibeoni (Babaandu ba Kibeoni se baba Baisiraeli tawe, baba Baamori ba barama. Akhaba Baisiraeli ne bechuba khubaliinda Saulo ayiima khubabunia, sikila aba ne sinani sie khuyeeta Baisiraeli ne babaandu Ba Yuda.)",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.21.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.21.2"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 21:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.21.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.21.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 21:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Khwako Daudi alaanga babaandu ba Kibeoni mala abareeba ali, “Mbakholela siina? Nduunga ndie kamabi niko mwakholelwa, nio mubiite chikhabi babaandu ba Wele Omunyali Owa Bioosi?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.21.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.21.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 21:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bakibeoni bakobosia bali, “Se khwenya Saulo ne lisaaye liewe bakhuelesie efwesa namwe esahabu tawe. Ne se khuli ne bunyali bwe khukhwira omundu yesi yesi mu Isiraeli tawe.” Daudi abareeba ali, “Nono siina nisio mwibaasia muli nyala namukholela?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.21.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.21.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 21:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bakobosia omwami bali, “Saulo enya khu khubunia efwe lundi se eenya khulekhakho mulala khwifwe amenye osi osi mu Isiraeli tawe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.21.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.21.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 21:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Khuelesie babaana bewe saba khu baana bewe basoleeli mala khubasuunge ebweeni wa Wele Omunyali Owa Bioosi e Kibeoni khu sikulu sia Wele Omunyali Owa Bioosi.” Omwami Daudi abakobosia ali, “Ese nja khumuelesia.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.21.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.21.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 21:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.21.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.21.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
